 ('vault112','Vault 112','Fallout Wiki contributors','https://fallout.fandom.com/wiki/Vault_112','Human bodies remain in long-running simulation loungers; caretaker Robobrains maintain the vault under Braun.','Bounded indexed background/layout; unrelated Vault 111 cryostasis entries were discarded after a blocked terminal query.'),
