 ('bigmt','Lobotomy','Fallout Wiki contributors','https://fallout.fandom.com/wiki/Lobotomy','Human-derived lobotomites perform maintenance and cleanup; Think Tank scientists continue experiments.','Not all human-derived workers are simple machines; scientific technology alone does not establish the whole crater’s allocation system.'),
