 ('vault-city','Vault City faction','Fallout Wiki contributors','https://fallout.fandom.com/wiki/Vault_City_%28faction%29','Citizens exclude outsiders while servants perform coerced physical and domestic labor.','Biological slave work is not automatic production; advanced medicine does not settle the missing general mechanism.'),
